Photographs. The Tel Aviv photographs in this repository (`public/tlv-*.jpg`,
`design/tlv-*.jpg`, `design/reference/`) are not licensed for reuse. They are
included because the design depends on them; all rights are reserved by their
owner.

Synagogue data. Prayer times and synagogue records derive from the Tel Aviv-Yafo
municipality GIS layer and from the Tel Aviv-Yafo Religious Council, and carry
whatever terms those sources attach. Nothing here asserts a claim over them.

Zmanim. Halachic times are computed by @hebcal/core under its own licence, and
the expected values in `docs/zmanim-ground-truth.md` are transcribed from
published luachot cited in that document.
